=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync not-read --------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu$
# 26.04, whose time service is chrony. A line of site.sources$
# names no server: the row and the servers are Unknown, and the$
# item refuses with words.$
$
# NTP Settings #################################################$
$
  [?] NTP                  Unknown ~ can't read$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Service              chrony$
  [+] Clock                In sync$
   -  Synced to            2.ntp.ubuntu.com$
  [?] Server               Unknown$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.10, 192.0.2.11$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          Can't read chrony's settings$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

